  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TRANSCULTURA: integrating Cuba, the Caribbean and the European Union through culture and industries and creativity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: TRANSCULTURA: integrating Cuba, the Caribbean and the European Union through culture and industries and creativity - The overall objective of the programme is to mobilise cultural heritage and creative industries in the Cuba/Caribbean region as vectors to  strengthen inclusive and sustainable socio-economic development and deepen integration within the Caribbean region and cooperation between the region and the European Union</narrative>
  </description>
